  "contract": "Requires PvpPower.Enable = 1. A High-Risk level 60 priest wearing a robe with PvP Power (+42) gets 42 x 0.02% = 0.84% more Power Word: Shield on top of the robe's own spell power. The robe's authored 30 spell power is cut by the content scaling: it is Classic item level 74 without a generated profile, so the RAID_MID band (69-75 -> 52-58) puts it at 57 and 30 x 57/74 rounds to 23. The PvP Power +42 comes from the spell id and is not cut. 1265 + int(23 x 0.8068) = 1283 (+1.42%) without the script, floor(1283 x 1.0084) = 1293 = 1.0221 of the 1265 base with it.",
